*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0037
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 364
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0037.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DPD-DAYS           PIC 9(3).
    05 BALANCE-DUE        PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 2000-LATE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2000-LATE-PENALTY.
    EVALUATE DPD-DAYS
        *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 7.5 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN 1 THRU 10
            MOVE 25 TO LATE-CHARGE
        *> LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 33 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN 11 THRU 45
            MOVE 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
        WHEN 46 THRU 999
            COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE = BALANCE-DUE * 0.08
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-EVALUATE.
